  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "數位平台課程自主學習輔導",
    "sub_ename": "MENTORING SELF-DIRECTED ONLINE LEARNING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以引導學生善用國內外知名大專校院及學術機構於線上課程平臺所提供之數位學習資源而設。學生參酌本系數位平台專業課程推薦清單，依個人學習需求與職涯發展，選擇適切的課程修習，突破時空限制，掌握前瞻專業知識。課程強調「自我管理、深度探索」，結合輔導教師的諮詢，進行學習任務追蹤及成果檢核等機制，以確保學習成效，培養學生個人的終身學習素養，並協助取得修課證明及完成學分認列，促進專業延伸學習。",
    "describe_eh": "This course empowers students to utilize high-quality digital learning resources offered by renowned universities and academic institutions. By referring to the department’s recommended list of digital courses, students can select subjects that align with their individual learning needs and career goals, enabling them to acquire advanced knowledge anytime and anywhere. Emphasizing self-management and in-depth exploration, the course integrates faculty guidance, structured learning tasks, and learning assessment to ensure effective learning outcomes. By fostering lifelong learning competencies, the course supports students in obtaining course completion certificates and earning academic credits, thereby expanding their professional horizons.",
